# Cursor Rules

- Always consult `AGENTS.md` for repository conventions and skill structure standards.
- When working within or invoking skills from `JobApplications/`, follow `JobApplications/AGENTS.md`:
  - Profile is stored in `job-work/profile.md` (generated by `resume-parse`).
  - Search postings against profile via `job-search`.
  - Draft applications via `apply-to-job` (answers cached in `job-work/answers.md`).
  - Never hallucinate resume details; always require user approval before submitting anything.
- Run `python scripts/validate-skills.py` locally before proposing changes.
